  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 9 year rows (昭和 1-9) + 1 sub-heading row + 總數 + 47 道府縣 + 樺太 = 59 rows as printed.",
   "年次 labels: printed 昭和 with small 年度 above the first figure and numerals 1-9; written as '昭和 1' … '昭和 9' (the figures are fiscal years, 年度). Sub-heading '地方別 (昭和九年度)' printed centred across the columns, kept as a row.",
   "Totals: in each of the 9 year rows the seven arm columns sum to the printed 總數; in the 地方別 block the 47 道府縣 + 樺太 sum to the printed 總數 row in every column (7,042; 3,458; 568; 220; 2,231; 46; 143; 376), and every row's columns sum to its 總數 — all reconcile. 昭和 9 year row equals the 地方別 總數 row.",
   "No unreadable cells."
